  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>east-west-steps-0 · 1×1×1 workgroups × 16×16×1 lanes = 256 invocations</h3><p class=\"lens-unknown\">invocation guard unknown</p><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-core-mat-mul-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-core-mat-mul-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"1\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; leftValues: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"2\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; rightValues: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"3\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; outputValues: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; leftTile: array&lt;array&lt;f32, 16&gt;, 16&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; rightTile: array&lt;array&lt;f32, 16&gt;, 16&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"6\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"7\">@compute @workgroup_size(16, 16)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"8\">fn main(@builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3u, @builtin(local_invocation_id) localId: vec3u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">  let workgroupIndex = (workgroupId.z * 1u + workgroupId.y) * 1u + workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"10\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 1u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"12\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">  let relativeRow = (workgroupIndex / 1u) * 16u + localId.y;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">  let row = 0u + relativeRow;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">  let column = (workgroupIndex % 1u) * 16u + localId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">  var sum = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">  for (var tileStart = 0u; tileStart &lt; 8u; tileStart += 16u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">    let leftColumn = tileStart + localId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">    let rightRow = tileStart + localId.y;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">    let leftIndex = row * 8u + leftColumn;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">    let rightIndex = rightRow * 8u + column;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">    leftTile[localId.y][localId.x] = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">    rightTile[localId.y][localId.x] = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">    if (relativeRow &lt; 8u &amp;&amp; leftColumn &lt; 8u &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">        leftIndex &gt;= 0u &amp;&amp; leftIndex - 0u &lt; 64u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">      leftTile[localId.y][localId.x] = leftValues[0u + leftIndex - 0u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">    if (rightRow &lt; 8u &amp;&amp; column &lt; 8u &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">        rightIndex &gt;= 0u &amp;&amp; rightIndex - 0u &lt; 64u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">      rightTile[localId.y][localId.x] = rightValues[0u + rightIndex - 0u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">    workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">    for (var inner = 0u; inner &lt; 16u; inner++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">      let leftElement = row * 8u + tileStart + inner;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">      let rightElement = (tileStart + inner) * 8u + column;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">      // Missing chunk contributions are absent, not zero times a potentially non-finite value.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">      if (relativeRow &lt; 8u &amp;&amp; column &lt; 8u &amp;&amp; tileStart + inner &lt; 8u &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">          leftElement &gt;= 0u &amp;&amp; leftElement - 0u &lt; 64u &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">          rightElement &gt;= 0u &amp;&amp; rightElement - 0u &lt; 64u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">        sum += leftTile[localId.y][inner] * rightTile[inner][localId.x];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">    workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">  let outputIndex = row * 8u + column;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  if (relativeRow &lt; 8u &amp;&amp; column &lt; 8u &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">      outputIndex &gt;= 0u &amp;&amp; outputIndex - 0u &lt; 64u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">    outputValues[0u + outputIndex - 0u] = sum;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>leftValues<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"elevation\">elevation</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>rightValues<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"forwardDifference\">forwardDifference</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>outputValues